{"id":"n62541-2-10","stage":4,"title":"대목 · 段落","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62541-2-10-1","ko":"무슨 소설인데 그렇게 울면서 읽어?","zh":"这是哪本小说啊，要哭着读吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么。","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"소설인데","meaning":"小说","explanation":"소설：小说；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"소설","audio":"/audio/88c77f43092f91561173.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32185","senseId":"1","lemma":"소설","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소설인데","audio":"/audio/af7c5170456bb01e05aa.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"울면서","meaning":"哭，哭泣","explanation":"울다：哭，哭泣；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"울다","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69523","senseId":"1","lemma":"울다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"울면서","audio":"/audio/29421338884e077fd51b.mp3"}},{"text":"읽어?","meaning":"阅读","explanation":"읽다：阅读；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"읽다","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68752","senseId":"2","lemma":"읽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"읽어","audio":"/audio/796762554f8ccb7c2ddf.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"88c77f43092f9156","term":"소설","zh":"小说","audio":"/audio/88c77f43092f91561173.mp3","entryId":"32185","definition":"作家虚构出来的、以故事形式写成的文学作品。","pronunciation":["소ː설"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"7136d2464083681e","term":"울다","zh":"哭，哭泣","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3","entryId":"69523","definition":"因为伤心、疼痛或太高兴而忍不住流眼泪；或指一边那样流眼泪一边发出声音。","pronunciation":["울ː다"]},{"id":"f843025cff483034","term":"읽다","zh":"阅读","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3","entryId":"68752","definition":"看文字了解其意思。","pronunciation":["익따"]}],"audio":"/audio/aef2032962e6f192ddb1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62541-2-10-2","ko":"지금 부모와 자식이 십 년 만에 만나는 대목이라고.","zh":"现在正是父母和子女十年后重逢的情节哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"부모와","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모：父母；와：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"부모","audio":"/audio/881a8172c7dcec2e64dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29559","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부모와","audio":"/audio/6ad21bda147d9e84ea2d.mp3"}},{"text":"자식이","meaning":"子女","explanation":"자식：子女；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"자식","audio":"/audio/b642f4b4b990f8387501.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49308","senseId":"1","lemma":"자식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자식이","audio":"/audio/b3fbd2b47305ca58aa80.mp3"}},{"text":"십","meaning":"十","explanation":"십：十。","readings":[{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28847","senseId":"1","lemma":"십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chines